WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:20.315
Bird was reading a book.

2
00:00:20.316 --> 00:00:25.136
The book was about a penguin.

3
00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:29.962
The penguin found a bottle on the beach.

4
00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.781
The bottle had a note inside.

5
00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:35.498
"Wow," thought Bird.

6
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:38.797
"I wonder what the note says."

7
00:00:38.798 --> 00:00:40.573
Bird read some more.

8
00:00:40.574 --> 00:00:43.190
The penguin in the book read the note.

9
00:00:43.191 --> 00:00:46.424
It said: I'm trapped on an island.

10
00:00:46.425 --> 00:00:48.392
Please send help!

11
00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:53.812
"This book is so good!" said Bird.

12
00:00:53.813 --> 00:01:03.518
Later Bird was at the pond.

13
00:01:03.519 --> 00:01:09.184
She saw a bottle near the water.

14
00:01:09.185 --> 00:01:12.291
"I have an idea," thought Bird.

15
00:01:12.292 --> 00:01:15.620
"I will put a note in this bottle.

16
00:01:15.621 --> 00:01:25.980
Maybe someone will find it!"

17
00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.434
Bird got a pencil and paper.

18
00:01:30.435 --> 00:01:33.502
She wrote a note.

19
00:01:33.503 --> 00:01:38.157
She put it into the bottle.

20
00:01:38.158 --> 00:01:51.878
Then she left the bottle in the pond.

21
00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:55.689
The next morning Kip saw the bottle.

22
00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.617
"That's strange," he said.

23
00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.883
"There's something in that bottle!"
